---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
// Article of the Year (IAOTY), rebuilt from the legacy ebneo.org/impact page as a year-by-year
// archive. The annual ballots are closed; the live monthly ballot lives at /vote.
---
<Base title="Article of the Year"
      description="The EBNEO Impact Article of the Year (IAOTY), the neonatal study the community judges most likely to change practice, by year.">
  <section class="panel">
    <h1 class="section" style="margin-top:8px"><Icon name="award2" />Article of the Year</h1>
    <p class="section-sub">The EBNEO Impact Article of the Year (IAOTY).</p>

    <div class="box" style="margin-bottom:28px">
      <p>The <strong>Impact Article of the Year (IAOTY)</strong> celebrates research that shapes
        neonatal practice and sparks global discussion. From the monthly
        <a href="/vote/">Impact Article of the Month</a>, EBNEO editors select the most impactful
        articles of the year, and the neonatal community votes, first a Round of 8, then a final
        head-to-head, to decide the winner. The award reflects both scientific excellence and the
        priorities of clinicians worldwide, true to EBNEO’s mission of making evidence-based
        neonatology accessible and impactful.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem">Each year’s ballots are
        closed and shown here for the record. The live monthly vote is on the
        <a href="/vote/">Vote</a> page.</p>
    </div>

    <article class="article impact">
